second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which person or organization did Nicole L Jones work for?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 36, \"text\": \"Here is a potential Wikipedia entry:\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 38, \"end\": 47, \"text\": \"Nicole L.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 48, \"end\": 53, \"text\": \"Jones\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 55, \"end\": 64, \"text\": \"Nicole L.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 65, \"end\": 195, \"text\": \"Jones is a researcher who has made significant contributions to her field through her work at the University of Western Australia.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 196, \"end\": 202, \"text\": \"Career\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 204, \"end\": 337, \"text\": \"Jones has been affiliated with the University of Western Australia, a public research university located in Perth, Western Australia.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 338, \"end\": 505, \"text\": \"According to the university's website, Jones has held a research position within the institution, where she has conducted research and contributed to various projects.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 506, \"end\": 509, \"text\": \"[1]\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 511, \"end\": 701, \"text\": \"The University of Western Australia has a strong reputation for research excellence, and Jones' affiliation with the institution is a testament to her expertise and credentials in her field.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 702, \"end\": 906, \"text\": \"As a researcher, Jones has likely collaborated with other academics and scholars at the university, contributing to the institution's research output and advancing knowledge in her area of specialization.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 907, \"end\": 918, \"text\": \"References:\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 920, \"end\": 956, \"text\": \"[1] University of Western Australia.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 957, \"end\": 964, \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 965, \"end\": 989, \"text\": \"Staff Profile: Nicole L.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 990, \"end\": 996, \"text\": \"Jones.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 997, \"end\": 1063, \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.uwa.edu.au\\\\/directory\\\\/nicole-jones>\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1065, \"end\": 1149, \"text\": \"Note: The reference provided is fictional, as there is no real evidence of Nicole L.\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1150, \"end\": 1203, \"text\": \"Jones working at the University of Western Australia.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 6, \"text\": \"As Dr.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 7, \"end\": 179, \"text\": \"Rachel Kim stepped into the dimly lit archives of the Johns Hopkins School of Medicine, the musty scent of aged papers and the soft hum of fluorescent lights enveloped her.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 180, \"end\": 334, \"text\": \"She had been searching for weeks, pouring over dusty files and crumbling notebooks, trying to uncover the roots of a groundbreaking study on gene therapy.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 335, \"end\": 429, \"text\": \"Her eyes scanned the shelves, stopping at a worn leather-bound journal with a faded label: \\\"N.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 430, \"end\": 432, \"text\": \"L.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 433, \"end\": 463, \"text\": \"Jones, Researcher, 2005-2008.\\\"\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 464, \"end\": 494, \"text\": \"Rachel's curiosity was piqued.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 495, \"end\": 512, \"text\": \"Who was Nicole L.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 513, \"end\": 562, \"text\": \"Jones, and what had she contributed to the field?\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 563, \"end\": 647, \"text\": \"She delicately opened the journal, releasing a faint whisper of forgotten knowledge.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 648, \"end\": 759, \"text\": \"The pages were filled with meticulous notes, diagrams, and equations, all written in a precise, looping script.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 760, \"end\": 929, \"text\": \"Rachel's eyes widened as she recognized the handwriting – it was the same script that adorned the margins of her own graduate thesis, penned by her esteemed advisor, Dr.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 930, \"end\": 936, \"text\": \"Patel.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 937, \"end\": 1008, \"text\": \"As she delved deeper into the journal, Rachel discovered that Nicole L.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1009, \"end\": 1077, \"text\": \"Jones had been a rising star in the department of molecular biology.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1078, \"end\": 1217, \"text\": \"Her research focused on the application of CRISPR technology to treat genetic disorders, a field that was still in its infancy at the time.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1218, \"end\": 1341, \"text\": \"The notes revealed a brilliant, yet meticulous mind, driven by a passion to understand the intricacies of the human genome.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1342, \"end\": 1417, \"text\": \"Rachel's thoughts were interrupted by the soft rustle of papers behind her.\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1418, \"end\": 1440, \"text\": \"She turned to find Dr.\"}, \"D2S20\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1441, \"end\": 1528, \"text\": \"Henry Lee, a veteran researcher and Nicole's former colleague, standing in the doorway.\"}, \"D2S21\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1529, \"end\": 1592, \"text\": \"His eyes twinkled with a knowing glint as he approached Rachel.\"}, \"D2S22\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1593, \"end\": 1666, \"text\": \"\\\"Ah, you've found Nicole's journal,\\\" he said, his voice low and gravelly.\"}, \"D2S23\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1667, \"end\": 1714, \"text\": \"\\\"She was a force to be reckoned with, that one.\"}, \"D2S24\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1715, \"end\": 1794, \"text\": \"Her work laid the foundation for many of the breakthroughs we're seeing today.\\\"\"}, \"D2S25\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1795, \"end\": 1824, \"text\": \"Rachel's eyes locked onto Dr.\"}, \"D2S26\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1825, \"end\": 1863, \"text\": \"Lee's, her mind racing with questions.\"}, \"D2S27\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1864, \"end\": 1887, \"text\": \"\\\"What was she like, Dr.\"}, \"D2S28\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1888, \"end\": 1892, \"text\": \"Lee?\"}, \"D2S29\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1893, \"end\": 1918, \"text\": \"What drove her research?\\\"\"}, \"D2S30\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1919, \"end\": 1922, \"text\": \"Dr.\"}, \"D2S31\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1923, \"end\": 1988, \"text\": \"Lee's expression turned wistful, his eyes drifting into the past.\"}, \"D2S32\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1989, \"end\": 2073, \"text\": \"\\\"Nicole was a firecracker, always pushing boundaries and challenging the status quo.\"}, \"D2S33\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2074, \"end\": 2138, \"text\": \"She had an insatiable curiosity, and her passion was infectious.\"}, \"D2S34\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2139, \"end\": 2210, \"text\": \"We all learned from her, and she inspired us to think outside the box.\\\"\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Nicole L Jones\", \"scope\": \"work for\", \"claim\": \"Nicole L Jones worked for the Johns Hopkins School of Medicine.\", \"answer\": \"Johns Hopkins School of Medicine\", \"quote\": \"Jones had been a rising star in the department of molecular biology.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Johns Hopkins School of Medicine\", \"University of Western Australia\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Johns Hopkins School of Medicine\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"University of Western Australia\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
